{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49191","headline":"广谪仙怨 · 窦弘余","name":"广谪仙怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡尘犯阙冲关，金辂提携玉颜。\n云雨此时萧散，君王何日归还。\n伤心朝恨暮恨，回首千山万山。\n独望天边初月，蛾眉犹自弯弯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦弘余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}